      "differential_matches_projected_expat_oracle": true,
      "projection_limit": "convert() returns no namespace information. Element keys and '@root' are DOM tagName values (prefix:local); attribute keys come from iterating DOMElement::attributes, whose keys are local names, so c:lang and p:currency appear as lang and currency; xmlns declarations are not attributes in the DOM and are absent. Neither control's four namespace URIs appears anywhere in the raw arrays (checked by the overlay build), the order control's <plain xmlns=\"\"> undeclaration is invisible, and two attributes with the same local name in different namespaces would collapse into one key. The adapter reports these keys as returned; the oracle therefore parses without namespace processing and strips attribute prefixes rather than resolving namespaces.",
